<title>INDIA: Delhi bourse trading hours for budget.</title>
<headline>Delhi bourse trading hours for budget.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Delhi Stock Exchange (DSE) has scheduled special trading sessions following the presentation of the Indian budget on Friday.</p>
<p>Finance Minister P. Chidambaram is scheduled to present the government's 1997/98 (April-March) budget at 5 p.m. (1130 GMT).</p>
<p>The DSE schedule is as follows:</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>DATE			    TRADING HOURS</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Friday, Feb 28</p>
<p> Pre-budget:	  - 9:45 a.m. to 3:00 p.m. (0415 to 0930 GMT)</p>
<p> Post-budget:	 - 6:00 p.m. to 8:00 p.m. (1230 to 1430 GMT)</p>
<p>----</p>
<p>Saturday, March 1   - 9:45 a.m. to 3:45 p.m. (0415 to 1015 GMT)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
